+// Multiplies mat with vec and puts the result in out.
+//
+// mat is a (kOuter, kInner)-shaped array, where element [i,j] is located at
+// index i * kInner + j.
+//
+// vec is a (kInner,)-shaped array.
+//
+// out is a (kOuter,)-shaped array that will set to mat @ vec.
